  "document": "Jack Arnold (director)\nJack Arnold( October 14, 1916 – March 17, 1992) was an American actor and film and television director, best known as one of the leading filmmakers of 1950s science fiction films. His most notable films are\" It Came from Outer Space\"( 1953),\" Creature from the Black Lagoon\"( 1954),\" Tarantula\"( 1955), and\" The Incredible Shrinking Man\"( 1957)."
